{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_6B83BED2","title":"Ava has some info on Thaddeus","entry":"Dlg_6B83BED2::entry","exit":"Dlg_6B83BED2::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_08A2DCDC","articyId":"72057645577587088","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"I know what you are going to ask. I do not know how Thaddeus knew you were in trouble. Nor do I know how we managed to dissuade Agent Teleshko.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I know what you are going to ask. I do not know how Thaddeus knew you were in trouble. Nor do I know how we managed to dissuade Agent Teleshko.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":350.0,"y":700.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39838","byteOffset":29400400,"byteLength":488}},{"id":"DFr_8244D8C8","articyId":"72057645577587108","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"I have no means to pass messages to Thaddeus.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I have no means to pass messages to Thaddeus.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":950.0,"y":700.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30662","byteOffset":19480360,"byteLength":356}},{"id":"DFr_E664099D","articyId":"72057645577587124","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"...He did tell me one thing. Before he left he said he was looking for \"answers.\"","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"...He did tell me one thing. Before he left he said he was looking for \"answers.\"","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1550.0,"y":700.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35696","byteOffset":27852912,"byteLength":392}},{"id":"DFr_E25731A9","articyId":"72057645577587138","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"He said he was looking for answers to \"the only thing without a WHY\". Does that make sense to you?","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"He said he was looking for answers to \"the only thing without a WHY\". Does that make sense to you?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2150.0,"y":700.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20307","byteOffset":15566520,"byteLength":444}},{"id":"DFr_30EA4BC4","articyId":"72057645577587159","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Interesting. I can only guess what that means.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Interesting. I can only guess what that means.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2750.0,"y":750.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19695","byteOffset":15334176,"byteLength":356}},{"id":"DFr_8469878E","articyId":"72057645577587174","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Is there always a \"why\"? Almost always. Why does the rain fall? Clouds form from water. Why does the wind blow? Air pressure and... such. Why am I rambling? I do not have enough data to talk clearly. Why is there something? ...There is no why. The question is invalid.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Is there always a \"why\"? Almost always. Why does the rain fall? Clouds form from water. Why does the wind blow? Air pressure and... such. Why am I rambling? I do not have enough data to talk clearly. Why is there something? ...There is no why. The question is invalid.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3350.0,"y":650.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19629","byteOffset":15308712,"byteLength":576}},{"id":"DFr_7D04720A","articyId":"72057645577587187","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Why is there anything? Is it a valid question to ask? When it comes to reality, WHY is it? Or... is there no \"why?\"","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Why is there anything? Is it a valid question to ask? When it comes to reality, WHY is it? Or... is there no \"why?\"","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3950.0,"y":700.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49754","byteOffset":33165472,"byteLength":496}},{"id":"DFr_86983754","articyId":"72057645577587238","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Indeed.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Indeed.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4850.0,"y":700.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"46692","byteOffset":31996888,"byteLength":316}},{"id":"DFr_341BBBF9","articyId":"72057606922862306","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Maybe.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Maybe.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4850.0,"y":925.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44287","byteOffset":31087920,"byteLength"